<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title>Sign-in unavailable &middot; SpellBot</title>
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#5A3EFD">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="https://spellbot.io/favicon.ico">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            color: #e0e0e0; min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem;
        }
        .card {
            background: #1e1e3f; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2.5rem; max-width: 460px; width: 100%; text-align: center;
        }
        .card img { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .card h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .card p { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .card ul { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .card code {
            background: #12122a; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        .card li + li { margin-top: 0.4rem; }
        .card a.back {
            display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.5rem; background: #5A3EFD; color: #fff;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .card a.back:hover { filter: brightness(110%); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <img src="https://spellbot.io/assets/img/avatar-icon.png" alt="SpellBot">
        <h1>Sign-in isn't set up here</h1>
        <p>This server can't sign you in with Discord because these settings are missing:</p>
        <ul>
            {% for name in missing %}
            <li><code>{{ name }}</code></li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p>Both come from your application in the Discord developer portal. See <code>ADMINISTRATION.md</code> for setup, then restart the web server.</p>
        <a class="back" href="/queues">Back to live games</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
